      "authorType": "TOPIC",
      "competitionRanking": 1662,
      "content": "<p>Lets say I train model on reasoning traces of much larger model, is that allowed?</p>\n<p>IF we can distill larger models, can we get rough list which models are allowed?</p>\n<p>For example someone generates 100k of reasoning traces using claude opus 4.6, since they don't have obfuscated reasoning traces. Than does SFT on those traces, would have imense advantage. Maybe even disilling nvidia/Nemotron-4-340B-Instruct or some other ultra large opensource model like kimi/deepseek.</p>",
